/target
.idea/
*.iml
/.idea

# Plots, exports and collected data are written into the working directory, which
# in practice is the repo root - so they are ignored *there* rather than by
# extension everywhere.
#
# A blanket `*.html` had silently excluded crates/.../session_viewer.html, which is
# pulled in with include_str!: the file was never committed and the build failed on
# every other machine. Anchoring the patterns to the root means a page or fixture
# living next to the code it belongs to can never be caught by accident.
# `just check_embedded` verifies that, if this ever needs loosening again.
/*.html
/*.csv
/*.zip
/session_*.json
/plot_*.html

# Recordings hold full command lines and the paths of open files, which routinely
# contain tokens and passwords. Ignored at any depth, on purpose.
sessions/

tmp/
test/
tst/
